@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #0b7a75

title What a capability does when it is asked to search: mine, write, read back what is in force, then ask or run

start

:the gateway posts the utterance and the
talk before it to the page that owns it
(POST /provider/find);

:mine the parameters out of the utterance
(mine_individual_provider_parameters);

if (the turn named a complaint?) then (yes)
  :resolve the kinds of care giver
  that treat it, and tick a default set;
else (no)
endif

:WRITE what was mined onto this page
(_write_page_parameters);
note right #f3f4f6
  Written before the search, so what an answer
  was produced under is on the session whatever
  the search then does. A page writes its own
  page and no other, ever.
end note

:READ BACK everything this page holds
(_parameters_in_force);
note right #f3f4f6
  This read is what makes an answer ADD to a
  request rather than replace it. Searching on
  the mined values alone threw away the city
  given a turn earlier and returned the whole
  of New York.
end note

:work out what is KNOWN as against
what was asked for
(_geography_known: a ZIP names its state);

:ask the declaration which parameters
this tool cannot run without
(required_parameters(tool));
note left #f3f4f6
  Read from tool_configuration, per TOOL and never
  per page: a page carries a search, a filter, a
  detail and a selection, and the search runs before
  any record is opened. Making a parameter required
  is an edit to the record and a deploy, not code.
end note

:subtract what is in force
(_unmet_requirements);
note right #f3f4f6
  A value present but empty is not in force. An empty
  string and a missing string are the same absence to
  the person who did not say it.
end note

if (any requirement unmet?) then (yes)
  :return their names
  as unmet_requirements;
  :author the question that asks for
  exactly those, by name
  (_question_for);
  :the gateway streams it as kind 'prompt'
  and appends it to the transcript;
  stop
else (no)
  :run the search on what is in force
  (find_care.search_providers);
  :return the rows, the panel they were
  narrowed by, and what was mined;
  stop
endif

@enduml
